      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is incredibly difficult to feel like a hollow shell when your physical experiences are so disconnected from your inner self. This intense fear of losing your identity is a profound struggle, but please remember that your worth is not defined solely by your ability to move or perform before an injury. Healing is a messy, nonlinear journey that prioritizes your existence and comfort over just returning to who you were.",
      "source": "target",
